# Frontend (Next.js) Conventions

- Prefer TypeScript React components and hooks.
- Use Tailwind CSS utility classes and Shadcn/Radix components for consistent UI.
- Keep the main upload/processing experience on a dedicated dashboard page.
- For long-running actions (vault processing), always show:
  - Loading state (spinners, progress bars, or status text).
  - Clear error messages when backend calls fail.
- When integrating with the backend:
  - Use a single configuration source for the API base URL.
  - Handle network and parsing errors gracefully, without crashing the UI.

